difference.fileB:
Inside plain XML element — every & becomes &amp;
every < becomes &lt; and every > becomes &gt;
Example:
  File A:  value: local!classAvgPercent & "%"
  File B:  value: local!classAvgPercent &amp; "%"

difference.fileA:
Raw operators inside CDATA:
        if(fv!row.math < 60, ...)
        if(fv!row.total >= 400, ...)

difference.fileB:
XML-escaped in element body:
        if(fv!row.math &lt; 60, ...)
        if(fv!row.total &gt;= 400, ...)
